Verse 1:
[D]Hear our prayer, O [A]Lord,
[A7]Hear [G]our [A7]prayer, O [D]Lord;
[D]Incline Thine ear [D7]to [G]us,
[Em]And [D]grant [A]us [A7]Thy [D]peace.
[G]A[D]men.
